msgstr "[.no-hyphens]#*failure-strategy*#"

msgid ""
"Specify the failure strategy to apply when a message produced from an AMQP message is nacked. Accepted values are `fail` (default), `accept`, `release`, `reject`, `modified-failed`, `modified-failed-undeliverable-here`\n"
